-## Workflow modes
-
-### `direct`
-
-Fast local loops in the current checkout. Use it for solo work, prototypes, and short tasks.
-
-### `branch_pr`
-
-Per-task branches, worktrees, PR artifacts, and integration handoff. Use it for teams and stricter
-review boundaries.
